cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "AETHER"
type: software
abstract: >-
  An experimental, CPU-first AI model and inference ecosystem, designed from
  scratch for efficient execution on legacy 32-bit x86 and modern systems.
  AETHER is at an early research and foundation stage: no model, trained
  weights, runtime, tokenizer, or benchmark results exist yet.
authors:
  # A CFF "entity" author (an organization rather than a person) permits only
  # name, alias, website, location, address fields and the like. No ORCID, email,
  # or given/family names are asserted, because none are verified for this project.
  - name: "Zelvior"
    website: "https://github.com/zelvior"
    location: "Pakistan"
repository-code: "https://github.com/zelvior/aether-ai"
url: "https://github.com/zelvior/aether-ai"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - "aether"
  - "machine learning"
  - "inference"
  - "cpu inference"
  - "x86"
  - "32-bit"
  - "research"
